cb-ground
/night cb-light
cb-harbour-back
newpath 0 0 moveto
cb-HZ 20 add 590 18 131 cb-stars
9 cb-moored-n
/cb-face -1 def /cb-boatlight true def /cb-hullc [0.42 0.64 0.90] def cb-tenth aload pop cb-gpblue cb-boat /cb-hullc [0.95 0.93 0.88] def /cb-boatlight false def /cb-face 1 def
cb-harbour-front true cb-hook-lamp
cb-hookx cb-hooky 14 sub 34 cb-glow
% the three of them walking home, small, toward the lit windows
/cb-face -1 def
/cb-step true def 50 cb-DECK 80 cb-grandpa 84 cb-DECK 52 cb-ana 114 cb-DECK 74 cb-mama /cb-step false def
/cb-face 1 def
showpage
